  "question": {
    "text": "To a stationary man, rain appears to be falling at his back at an angle <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math> with the vertical. As he starts moving forward with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.5&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> he finds that rain falls vertically. The speed of rain with respect to stationary man is"
  },
