  "solution": {
    "text": "For stationary person<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0061_123dda333e89.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 174px; height: 163px;\" /><br />For running person<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0061_4a2ed6d85af8.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 146px; height: 146px;\" /><br />Speed of rain with respect to a stationary man <math><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>&#957;</mi></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />The velocity of rain with respect to man,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>M</mi></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br />Since <math><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>V</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></math> is vertically downward, its <math><mi>x</mi></math>-component will become zero.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>0.5</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mi>o</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
